\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {19}{\ignorespaces Private diagnosis on real biomedical images, image \emph  {and} weights encrypted, only the class index revealed. DermaMNIST is read on balanced accuracy and AUC: its largest class is \SI {66.88}{\percent } of the test set, which published ResNet-18 beats by under seven points. Its RGB input costs nothing extra---an RGB $28\times 28$ convolution needs degree \num {3977} against $n=4096$ and so fits one ciphertext at one multiplication per output channel, which is why its latency matches the grayscale rows.}}{60}{table.19}\protected@file@percent }
